{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47228","headline":"武肃王有旨石桥设斋会进士一诗共六首 三 · 吴越僧","name":"武肃王有旨石桥设斋会进士一诗共六首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"智泉福海莫能逾，亲自王恩运睿谟。\n感现尽冥心境界，资持全固道根株。\n石梁低翥红鹦鹉，烟岭高翔碧鹧鸪。\n胜妙重重惟祷祝，永资军庶息灾虞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴越僧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47228.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47228","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}